1
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,177
Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu Yu-Gi-Oh!

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,157
Yu-Gi-Oh!

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,157
Y-Gi-Oh!

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,420
Yu-Gi!

5
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,040
Yu-ge-Oh!

6
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:23,800
Yu-Gi!

7
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,520
Yu-Gi!

8
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:07,540
Your parasite-infected
monster still can't attack me.

9
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,172
Well, it's not over yet.

10
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,517
Give it up, Wheeler.

11
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:13,097
Now that my ultimate
great moth has emerged,

12
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:16,945
you're as good as Squashed, and
your two locator cards are mine.

13
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:18,180
You wish.

14
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:20,020
Zap that big bug, Joey.

15
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,140
Stay focused.

16
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:24,857
You'll be saying goodbye to
Battle City in no time, Wheeler.

17
00:01:24,940 --> 00:01:25,770
Whatever.

18
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:29,652
Prepare to witness the devastating
power of my Great Moth!

19
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,000
Destroy his alligator sword now!

20
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:45,177
Come on, you must have some kind of giant
fly swatter or something in your deck.

21
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:46,300
What are you?

22
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,340
His pom-pom girl?

23
00:01:48,540 --> 00:01:50,017
Don't make me come over there.

24
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:50,930
Look,

25
00:01:51,013 --> 00:01:53,577
thanks to the parasites living
off his side of the field,

26
00:01:53,660 --> 00:01:56,060
All of Wheeler's cards are now insects,

27
00:01:56,260 --> 00:01:59,897
allowing my insect barrier to
block every one of their attacks.

28
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:00,810
Besides,

29
00:02:00,893 --> 00:02:03,457
only Gate Guardian and the
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon

30
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:06,580
have enough attack points
to defeat my Great Moth.

31
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:10,171
And I doubt you have neither
of them in your pathetic deck.

32
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:12,930
Uh-oh.

33
00:02:13,140 --> 00:02:15,017
It doesn't look too good for Joey.

34
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:17,017
The Great Moth is just too tough.

35
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:19,276
Maybe we should just log offline now.

36
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:20,500
No way, Kenda.

37
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:23,664
Joey's gonna win and we're
not giving up on him.

38
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,760
How can you be so sure?

39
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,017
His life points keep getting lower.

40
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:32,041
Joey hasn't been able to attack,
and this monster seems unbeatable.

41
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:35,017
Maybe the best move is to
just run away and hide.

42
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:37,218
You mean kind of like you did today?

43
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,780
I guess.

44
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:43,597
Some things are just really scary, especially
when you have to do them all alone.

45
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:47,400
And I don't want my x-ray taken,
so I'm gonna stay in here.

46
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:50,437
How am I ever gonna crush
Weevil's great moth?

47
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,577
That thing's too strong, and none
of my monsters can attack anyway.

48
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:55,840
Come on, Deck, show me some love.

49
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,680
Yes, just a card I needed, baby.

50
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,617
Look out, you little vermin.

51
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:02,759
Joey's got a plan.

52
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:08,100
I place one card face down and switch
all my monster cards to attack mode.

53
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:11,100
Did I hear Joey right?

54
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:14,877
How can Joey attack Weevil's moth
when his monsters are weaker?

55
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,717
The pressure's finally gotten to him.

56
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,800
He's cracking up.

57
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:21,000
Unless he's doing what I think he is.

58
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,000
Bring it on.

59
00:03:22,380 --> 00:03:23,460
You got it.

60
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:30,117
I doubt that a fool like you could have
anything sneaky planned, but just in case,

61
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:32,317
I'll place this monster in defense mode.

62
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,459
Now, you remember Legol, don't you?

63
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:38,000
Perhaps I should refresh your memory.

64
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,670
Legol!

65
00:03:39,753 --> 00:03:43,120
Bypass his monsters and attack
his flight points directly!

66
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:49,360
Get up, Joey!

67
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,550
Now,

68
00:03:52,633 --> 00:03:55,177
since you put your parasite
card in attack mode and

69
00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:57,857
it's technically your
weakest monster on the field,

70
00:03:57,940 --> 00:04:02,116
I'm going to attack it, which will
knock your life points down to zero.

71
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,400
Finish him off, my great morph!

72
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,540
Nice try, Bug Brain.

73
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:09,280
Reveal Skull Dice!

74
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:14,277
This card will reduce your monster's attack
power depending on the roll of the die.

75
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,797
So the higher the number,
the weaker your morph gets.

76
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:17,710
Huh?

77
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,400
What? A two?

78
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:28,014
Oh, well, it still cuts the attack
points of your oversized pest in half.

79
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:32,920
That was a sad attempt
to survive, Wheeler.

80
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:35,965
My moth can still blow
your parasite to pieces.

81
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,300
Don't count on it.

82
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:40,100
I'll reveal my other face-down card.

83
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:43,400
The magic card, Graceful Dice.

84
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:49,180
Part two of my ingenious
master plan The higher I roll,

85
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:51,797
the stronger my parasite
monster will become,

86
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:56,860
you little Pyramid Bet you're sorry
you snuck that into my deck now, huh?

87
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,760
It can't be!

88
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,680
I need a four or higher to swat you more

89
00:05:10,660 --> 00:05:11,777
All right!

90
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:15,980
Parasite Parasite's attack
points multiply by 4 to 2,000!

91
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,700
I can't watch!

92
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,800
Say bye-bye to your fuck!

93
00:05:22,020 --> 00:05:22,850
Ah!

94
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,980
Up high!

95
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:28,000
I knew Joey could do it!

96
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,260
Great dueling!

97
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:30,690
Whoa!

98
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:31,990
Oh.

99
00:05:32,073 --> 00:05:32,903
Hey, check it out.

100
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:36,400
Serenity, Joey just crushed
Weevil's great moth.

101
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:40,013
And he used the card Weevil
snuck into his deck to do it.

102
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:43,020
That's right, Weevil. Joey's back.

103
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:45,731
My moth, my precious, precious great moth.

104
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:48,076
You've squashed it like a common fly.

105
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,950
You'll pay.

106
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:52,177
This duel isn't over yet, Wheeler.

107
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:53,280
Not by a mile.

108
00:05:53,820 --> 00:05:55,320
Bring it on, Weevil.

109
00:05:55,460 --> 00:05:57,872
I'll exterminate all you little critters.

110
00:05:58,340 --> 00:05:59,800
You won that round.

111
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:03,986
But my next surprise will win me
the duel and send you packing.

112
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:06,577
Huh, we'll just see about that, Weevil.

113
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:07,520
Yes, we will.

114
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:09,380
First, I'll play this.

115
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,010
Ta-da!

116
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:14,200
My insect soldiers of the sky!

117
00:06:18,700 --> 00:06:22,840
Next comes a magic card,
Eradicating Aerosol.

118
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:27,057
This card has the power to destroy
any insect card on the field.

119
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:31,100
And since all of your parasite-infected
monsters are still insects,

120
00:06:31,380 --> 00:06:34,880
I could take one of them out,
but I've got bigger plans.

121
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,560
So I play Pinch Hopper.

122
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:42,320
And now I can destroy my
own insect. What gives?

123
00:06:42,540 --> 00:06:44,697
Once Pinch Hopper goes to the graveyard,

124
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:47,368
Weevil can summon any
monster from his hand.

125
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,280
Any monster? Yes!

126
00:06:49,740 --> 00:06:51,700
Eradicating aerosols! Now!

127
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,500
Destroy my Pinch Hopper!

128
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:59,219
Now I can summon a creature whose
attack power is virtually limitless

129
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,140
Insect queen

130
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:05,737
She's my rarest card and
if played the right way

131
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:08,560
is totally unstoppable
Prepare to lose it all,

132
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,510
Wheeler

133
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:18,717
You may have defeated my great moth
But my queen will trounce your puny

134
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:23,329
defense and wipe out your life points
Now you will face a power like no other

135
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:28,060
Say goodbye to Battle City!

136
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:33,620
If you think my insect
queen is powerful now,

137
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:36,197
just wait until you see
her special function.

138
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:39,357
She absorbs the attack points
of every insect on the field.

139
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:42,297
It's still got less than your
moth, and I creamed that thing.

140
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:43,674
You weren't listening.

141
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:49,160
She absorbs the points of every insect,
yours included. Mine? That's right.

142
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:53,177
My monsters are still considered insects
because of that stinking parasite.

143
00:07:53,260 --> 00:07:54,090
Exactly!

144
00:07:54,173 --> 00:07:56,001
Now absorb their power, my queen!

145
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:59,216
That's a thousand more attack points!

146
00:07:59,780 --> 00:08:02,820
Come on! Oh, no! Joey! Remember,

147
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:07,057
insect cards can be extremely tricky,
and to battle an insect duelist,

148
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:09,197
you have to think like an insect duelist!

149
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:13,221
You destroyed his great moth, and
you can destroy his insect queen!

150
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,010
Uh-oh.

151
00:08:16,820 --> 00:08:21,114
Now Joey's up against a monster that's
even stronger than the great moth.

152
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:22,760
It could be over.

153
00:08:23,260 --> 00:08:25,277
How can he face that thing all alone?

154
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,480
It's too powerful.

155
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,640
Joey isn't alone, Kenta.

156
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:30,837
He knows I'm always there with him.

157
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:34,449
And if I need help, I know my
brother's always there for me.

158
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,875
When I was scared to get my operation,

159
00:08:36,980 --> 00:08:39,637
he gave me the strength I
needed to go through with it.

160
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,249
He's more than my brother.

161
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:45,576
Joey's my friend, and we're there to
support each other no matter what.

162
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:48,407
So even though I'm not
next to him right now,

163
00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:52,497
he knows I believe in him, and our bond
of friendship will always be there.

164
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:56,100
Hey, will you be my friend? Sure. Thanks.

165
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:59,097
So if you ever get frightened,
I'll be there for you.

166
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:01,597
But right now, Joey
needs both of our help.

167
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,080
So let's cheer him on.

168
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:06,840
And now I give my queen
another power boost.

169
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:09,080
I sacrifice Legol.

170
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:13,780
The more she feeds, the
more powerful she becomes.

171
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:15,806
Well, that's just disgusting.

172
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,820
Insect queen, attack!

173
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:20,585
Annihilate this tiny guardian.

174
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:31,120
Now your monster is Bug Juice, and
you lost some serious life points.

175
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,517
And it gets better.

176
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,776
With every monster my queen
destroys, she lays an egg.

177
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:43,662
These eggs let her keep the extra attack
points even after the monster's destroyed.

178
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:48,268
Plus, when these eggs hatch,
I'll have an entire insect army.

179
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:51,597
I gotta scramble those eggs before
any munchkin monsters hatch.

180
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,937
They'll be on me like
a swarm of killer bees,

181
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:57,737
but as long as Weevil's insect
barrier is in effect, I can't attack.

182
00:09:57,820 --> 00:10:01,977
Even if I do summon a monster, that
parasite card will turn it into a bug,

183
00:10:02,060 --> 00:10:05,657
and then his insect queen will absorb
its attack points and get stronger.

184
00:10:05,740 --> 00:10:07,858
There's got to be a way out of this.

185
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,340
Here goes nothing.

186
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:14,260
I'll place one card face down
on the field and end my turn.

187
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:19,600
Joey, you forgot to switch all your
monsters back into defense mode.

188
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:21,600
Tough luck!

189
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,957
Now there's nothing defending your
life points against my attacks!

190
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,940
Time to finish you off, Wheeler!

191
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,320
Oh no!

192
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:32,877
If Joey's attacked now, his
life points will drop to zero!

193
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,260
So long, Wheeler!

194
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:39,060
I summon Cockroach
Knight to feed my queen!

195
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:43,537
And whenever my cockroach is destroyed,
it returns to the top of my deck,

196
00:10:43,620 --> 00:10:46,737
so I can keep sacrificing it
to increase my queen strength!

197
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:49,220
And now, my Insect Queen,

198
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:53,760
destroy his panther, then knock
him out of the tournament for good!

199
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:57,280
Now, Insect Queen, attack!

200
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,426
Your life points are history!

201
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:01,300
Don't be so sure, Weaver.

202
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:04,597
Let's see if you can guess
what's beneath card number one.

203
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:06,320
No, not a trap card!

204
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:09,977
You kept your monsters in attack
mode on purpose, didn't you?

205
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:11,260
On the nosy.

206
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:14,917
And because you fell for it and
went for the kill, it's time to pay.

207
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,340
Activate magic arm shield.

208
00:11:22,140 --> 00:11:24,380
My insect soldiers of the sky!

209
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:27,617
My magic arm shield lets me
defend myself against your

210
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:31,053
attack by using one of your
monsters to deflect the blow.

211
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:39,848
Now who's point to history?

212
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:45,900
What strategy?

213
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:49,788
Joey just slipped through Weevil's
traps for the second time.

214
00:11:50,820 --> 00:11:52,585
I knew you would, big brother.

215
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:57,217
You may have blocked one attack, but
you're just prolonging your defeat.

216
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:59,060
I can't stand him.

217
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:02,437
Joey'll shut him up as soon as
he destroys that insect queen.

218
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,677
What's the matter, Wheeler?

219
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:06,437
Did your fleece-sized brain
run out of ideas already?

220
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:07,637
There's no way out.

221
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,300
As my queen gets stronger,

222
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:12,917
she'll continue to lay eggs that'll
hatch into a swarm of insect warriors.

223
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:17,620
And as if that wasn't enough to ensure
my victory in this dual wheeler,

224
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,297
thanks to my insect barrier,

225
00:12:19,380 --> 00:12:20,733
you still can't attack.

226
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:23,240
Don't count your eggs yet.

227
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:27,659
To protect my life points, I'll put
both my monsters in defense mode.

228
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:31,357
Looks like someone's running
out of options, but relax.

229
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,734
I promise that I'll finish you quickly.

230
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,200
You recognize this?

231
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:37,240
It's cockroach night again!

232
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:39,340
Eat and grow strong, my queen!

233
00:12:40,460 --> 00:12:43,260
And now, attack his panther warrior.

234
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,440
Another one bites the dust. Oh, man.

235
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:58,437
The only thing standing in between Weevil
and my life points is that parasite cod.

236
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:00,897
I gotta summon another monster
if I want to squash him.

237
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:01,957
But whatever I summon,

238
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:05,746
I'll become infected by the
parasite and feed his insect queen.

239
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:08,340
And once those eggs hatch,

240
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:13,365
I'm in real trouble Time to hand over your
two locator cards and go home, Wheeler

241
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:20,040
Maybe Bug Boy's right I used
up my best cards already,

242
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,984
and that queen's way too strong

243
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:28,340
Hang in there, Joey We're all behind
you Trust yourself, Joey Trust your deck

244
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:34,500
Focus, Joey You've gotten out of tougher
situations than this before And remember,

245
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:36,457
Serenity looks to you for strength,

246
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:39,599
so you've got to stomp this
termite for your sister.

247
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:41,850
Tristan's right.

248
00:13:41,933 --> 00:13:43,277
Serenity's never given up on me.

249
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,657
When I dueled that
psychic fraud, Esperoba,

250
